    "https://www.chc.edu/careers-at-chc/employment-opportunities/adjunct-spanish/": {
      "title": "Adjunct – Spanish",
      "description": "Adjunct - Spanish - Chestnut Hill College Skip to main content Apply Visit Info Alumni Give Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Students Transfer Students Graduate Student Admissions Accelerated Adult Students Tuition and Financial Aid Academics Academic Centers Degrees and Programs Student Support Services Career Development Meet the Faculty Student Life Clubs and Programs Student Leadership Career Development Health, Wellness, and Fitness Safety and Security Athletics About Chestnut Hill College Celebrates 100 Years Welcome From the President Mission Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion History and College Seal Faculty & Staff Directory Search Icon Apply Visit Info Alumni Give Search Icon Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Students Transfer Students Graduate Student Admissions Accelerated Adult Students Tuition and Financial Aid Academics Academic Centers Degrees and Programs Student Support Services Career Development Meet the Faculty Student Life Clubs and Programs Student Leadership Career Development Health, Wellness, and Fitness Safety and Security Athletics About Chestnut Hill College Celebrates 100 Years Welcome From the President Mission Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion History and College Seal Faculty & Staff Directory Resources for Prospective Students Current Students Parents and Families Alumnae/i Faculty & Staff Directory Quicklinks News & Publications Events Event Rentals Careers at CHC Instagram Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Twitter Adjunct – Spanish Home Careers at CHC Employment Opportunities Adjunct – Spanish The Center for Integrated Humanities at Chestnut Hill College in Philadelphia, PA, invites applications for an Adjunct Professor of Spanish beginning in the Spring of 2026. Course Information SPAN 101 – Elementary Spanish I SPAN 102 – Elementary Spanish II SPAN 103 – Intermediate Spanish I On-campus, in-person teaching is preferred, but hybrid teaching may be considered subject to approval by the Office of Academic Affairs. Opportunities for teaching in Fall 2026 (and subsequent semesters) are also available. Requirements Master’s degree (or higher) in Spanish or closely related discipline Previous college-level teaching experience is a plus Exhibited evidence of continued professional growth and development About Chestnut Hill College Chestnut Hill College, founded by the Sisters of Saint Joseph in 1924, is an independent, Catholic institution that strives to foster equality through holistic education within a strong liberal arts tradition.  The mission of the College is dedicated to promoting the spiritual, academic, social, ethical, and moral development of the whole person.  The College, situated in Chestnut Hill, a charming neighborhood in Northwest Philadelphia, serves a culturally diverse student body. Contact Information: Interested candidates should submit a letter of interest, areas of scholarly or clinical interest, curriculum vitae, and contact information for three references via ADP Workforce Now HERE .  No phone calls, please. Interviewing will begin immediately and will continue until the position is filled. Official graduate and undergraduate transcripts must also be submitted if granted an interview and hire. Chestnut Hill College is an employer committed to a culture of diversity, equity, and inclusion as a core value.  To foster an inclusive community and support our diverse student body, we embrace equal access. We welcome applications from candidates of all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and encourage applications from groups historically underrepresented in higher education.  We are committed to increasing the diversity of the college community and the curriculum. Chestnut Hill College is an equal opportunity employer Explore Adjunct – Spanish Associate Registrar Undergraduate Admissions Counselor Head Men and Women's Tennis Coach (Part-time, Seasonal) Financial Aid Counselor Certified Registered Nurse Practitioner (CRNP) Center Chair, Nursing Assistant Athletic Trainer, Fulltime (10 Months) Direct Support Professional - Life Skills through Career Program Clinical Nursing Adjunct - Medical Surgical Adjunct - Spanish Instructor - Computer and Information Sciences Assistant Professor/Field Placement Coordinator (MCCP) Nursing Adjunct Faculty, Clinical Maternal Child Health (OB Fall 2026) Adjunct - Computer Programming Assistant Professor/Instructor of Cybersecurity (Faculty/ 9 Months) 9601 Germantown Ave Philadelphia, PA 19118 215-248-7000 Contact Instagram Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Twitter Menu Resources Prospective Students Current Students Alumnae/i Parents and Families Faculty & Staff Directory Policies and Reports Center for Accessibility and Learning Services Careers at CHC Web Accessibility Discover Admissions & Aid Academics Student Life Neurodiversity Initiative Athletics CHC Bookstore Quick Links Safety and Security Directions and Parking News & Publications Events Comms Request Form myCHC Email Office 365 Logue Library Canvas IT Help Desk Resources Also of Interest Consumer Information Campus Crisis Protocols and Closing Information Giving Societies Ways to Give Related Pages Foreign Language Resource Center Center for Integrated Humanities Minors Clinical Nursing Adjunct – Medical Surgical"
